+/*********************************************************************************
+ * @file		om_camera_component.cc
+ * @brief		om_camera_component belongs to CICTCI
+ * @details
+ * @author		alfred
+ * @email       zhangenwei64@gmail.com
+ * @date		24-6-12
+ * @copyright	Copyright (c) 2024 Mec-Airos Division.
+ * @verbatim
