+/*********************************************************************************
+ * @file		file_util.cpp
+ * @brief		file_util belongs to CICTCI
+ * @details
+ * @author		cs
+ * @date		 2024-02-01
+ * @copyright	Copyright (c) 2024 CICTCI-Airos Division.
